---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const stages=[['01','A Safe Place for Healing','Creating an atmosphere of confidentiality, compassion, trust, honesty, and freedom from judgment.'],['02','Healing a Stony Heart','Understanding how pain can cause us to protect ourselves, become emotionally hardened, disconnect, or stop trusting.'],['03','Emotional Needs','Understanding God-given needs such as love, belonging, security, affirmation, respect, acceptance, comfort, and connection.'],['04','Healing the Pain of Unmet Needs','Recognizing where important needs were not met and how that pain can continue to affect thoughts, emotions, relationships, and behaviour.'],['05','Grieving Losses','Learning to acknowledge and grieve what was lost rather than burying, minimizing, or continually carrying it.'],['06','Understanding Forgiveness','Understanding what forgiveness is and is not, addressing misconceptions, and walking toward freedom without dismissing the seriousness of what happened.'],['07','Healing for Rejection','Recognizing wounds and beliefs created through rejection and receiving truth, acceptance, identity, and restoration.'],['08','Restoring Trust','Understanding how trust was broken and how healthy trust—with God, ourselves, and safe people—can gradually be rebuilt.']];
---
<BaseLayout title="The Healing Journey | Healing the Heart">
  <section class="page-hero"><div class="page-hero-inner"><p class="eyebrow">The journey</p><h1>Healing &amp; Restoring the Heart</h1><p>Healing is not about pretending the past didn't happen. It is about honestly bringing wounded places into the light and learning what Jesus can restore.</p></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">Eight areas of the journey</p><h2>One honest step at a time.</h2><p>The journey includes teaching, workbook exercises, reflection, prayer, journaling, review questions, and small-group ministry.</p></div><div class="content-grid">{stages.map(([n,title,text])=><article class="content-card"><span class="num">{n}</span><h3>{title}</h3><p>{text}</p></article>)}</div></section>
  <section class="dark-section section"><div class="rich-section"><p class="eyebrow light">How we participate</p><h2>There are no spectators.</h2><p>The healing process invites personal honesty and participation. What you receive from the journey is connected to your willingness to engage honestly with it.</p><p>The atmosphere is confidential and compassionate. You are given space to reflect, ask questions, pray, learn, and take the next step at a pace that respects the seriousness of your story.</p></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
